Vendored third-party code

vendor/tiny_http is tiny_http 0.12.0 (https://github.com/tiny-http/tiny-http),
copyright its authors, licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0 — both license texts
are kept beside it. Undercroft carries it as a `[patch.crates-io]` with one
change, every line of which is marked `UNDERCROFT PATCH` and recorded in
vendor/tiny_http/UNDERCROFT.patch: an unread request body is no longer
drained on drop (an allocation of the client's declared size, upstream
issue #290) and a request's header block is bounded. See ROADMAP O114.

